  gChipsetPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdH2OPreferDtpmBootSupported|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x10000016
  gChipsetPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdEcCapsuleUpdateSupported|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x10000017
