  gChipsetPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdDashSupported|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x10000014
  gChipsetPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdH2OIhisiToolBackwardSupport|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x1000001B

  gChipsetPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdH2OBiosUpdateFlashSequenceEnabled|TRUE|BOOLEAN|0x100000A3
  
